ars they  were drinking I said I want to give you  that  your life cause you know food for us to  get her safe judge so I received it in  our just hitting a cutlass were given at  the back of my my back  I'd hurry Cutlass one give me slap on  that it was it's willow until now  kidnappers in Nigeria targeted public  officials the relatives and foreign work  is often in the oil industry what is  worrying most Nigerians about the  current wave of kidnappings in their  country is that no one and nowhere feel  safe anymore  Hamad Al Jazeera on the Abuja Kaduna  highway
 

